      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawn%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Joshua Whitney, a Massachusetts miller, named the settlement Dawn after establishing a homestead near Shoal Creek in the early 1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
