      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.livcolib.org/History/Community/Dawn/dawn1.htm",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Settlers in 1829 helped construct a mill dam that later became a local landmark in Dawn’s early history.",
